)F FUNCTION -                                                           00050003
   THE LISTCRA COMMAND IS USED TO LIST THE CONTENTS OF A GIVEN          00100003
   CATALOG RECOVERY AREA (CRA).                                         00150003
)X SYNTAX -                                                             00200003
         LISTCRA                                                        00250003
                   INFILE('DNAME'...)                                   00350003
                   OUTFILE('DNAME')                                     00400003
                   COMPARE | NOCOMPARE                                  00450003
                   DUMP | NAME | SEQUENTIALDUMP                         00500003
                   CATALOG('CATNAME'/'PASSWORD' 'DNAME')                00550003
                   MASTERPW('PASSWORD')                                 00600003
  REQUIRED - INFILE                                                     00700003
  DEFAULTS - NOCOMPARE                                                  00800003
             NAME                                                       00850003
  ABBREVIATIONS -                                                       01000003
      NOTE - IN ADDITION TO NORMAL TSO SHORT FORMS, THESE ARE ACCEPTED. 01050003
             LISTCRA              LISTR                                 01100003
             INFILE               IFILE                                 01200003
             OUTFILE              OFILE                                 01250003
             COMPARE              CMPR                                  01300003
             NOCOMPARE            NCMPR                                 01350003
             MASTERPW             MRPW                                  01400003
             SEQUENTIALDUMP       SDUMP                                 01450003
)O OPERANDS -                                                           01700003
))INFILE('DNAME'...)                                                    02300003
           - SPECIFIES THE NAMES OF THE DD STATEMENTS THAT IDENTIFY     02350003
             THE CRAS TO BE LISTED.                                     02400003
  'DNAME'  - NAME OF THE DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES ONE CRA TO        02450003
             BE LISTED.                                                 02500003
))OUTFILE('DNAME')                                                      02550003
           - SPECIFIES THE NAME OF THE DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES     02600003
             AN ALTERNATE OUTPUT DATA SET FOR THE LISTING CREATED       02650003
             BY LISTCRA.  IF THIS IS NOT GIVEN, THE OUTPUT IS SENT TO   02700003
             THE TERMINAL.                                              02710003
  'DNAME'  - NAME OF THE DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES THE ALTERNATE     02750003
             OUTPUT DATA SET.                                           02800003
))COMPARE -  THE CRAS ARE TO BE COMPARED WITH THE CATALOG SPECIFIED     03150003
             VIA THE CATALOG PARAMETER.                                 03250003
))NOCOMPARE                                                             03300003
           - THE CRAS ARE NOT TO BE COMPARED WITH ANY CATALOG.          03350003
))DUMP     - THE LISTING PRODUCED BY LISTCRA IS TO BE IN DUMP FORMAT.   03450003
))NAME     - THE LISTING PRODUCED BY LISTCRA IS TO CONSIST ONLY         03600003
             OF THE NAMES OF THE OBJECTS FOUND IN THE CRA.              03700003
))SEQUENTIALDUMP                                                        03710003
           - THE LISTING PRODUCED BY LISTCRA IS AN UNSORTED             03712003
             FULL DUMP OF THE RECORD CONTENTS OF THE CRA.               03720003
))MASTERPW - SPECIFIES THE MASTER PASSWORD OF THE MASTER CATALOG.       03750003
  'PASSWORD'                                                            03850003
           - SPECIFIES THE MASTER PASSWORD OF THE MASTER CATALOG        03860003
             FOR THE ENTIRE SYSTEM.                                     03900003
))CATALOG  - SPECIFIES THE NAME OF A VSAM CATALOG TO BE COMPARED        03950003
             WITH THE CRAS.                                             04000003
  'CATNAME'                                                             04050003
           - GIVES THE NAME OF THE CATALOG TO BE COMPARED WITH THE      04060003
             CATALOG RECOVERY AREAS.                                    04070003
  'PASSWORD'                                                            04080003
           - SPECIFIES THE PASSWORD OF THE CATALOG TO BE COMPARED       04090003
             WITH THE CATALOG RECOVERY AREAS.                           04092003
  'DNAME'  - SPECIFIES THE DD STATEMENT THAT IDENTIFIES THE CATALOG     04094003
             TO BE COMPARED AS A DATA SET.                              04096003
  REQUIRED - 'CATNAME'                                                  04146003
